  "bio": "\"Traditional expertise meets modern flair at Phill Bartell's tattoo studio, nestled in the creative heart of Boulder, United States. This cozy ink haven is home to a collective of distinguished artists including @mo__malone, @tarynmce_tattoo, @debra.entendre, @stevie.tattoos, and #darrenhalltattoo, who together forge timeless body art in an ambiance of vibrant professionalism.\"\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Boulder, Colorado, United States"
